  "summary": {
    "kind": "quote",
    "span": {
      "end": 1797,
      "end_line": 20,
      "line": 20,
      "start": 1277
    },
    "text": "The operator asked for a role that sits **equally between the strategist and the red-team**, checks every piece of inbound reading and learning, disproves hallucinations, values truth above all, keeps a record of what it did, and has **one special power: ratifying inbound reading into the core knowledge base**, after corroborating it from reputable sources and storing the link and metadata as frontmatter. Verification is a **skill**. If it cannot validate a fact with full confidence, it raises it with the operator."
  }
